          "settings": {
            "heading": "About Short Course (Non-Accredited)",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Short Course meets the minimum requirements set by AS/NZS 3760 and still allows you to freely test and tag as you wish. Although it also involves learning the same information, it has some minor differences:</p><ul><li>No OHS component</li><li>Issued with Certificate of Attendance</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_RUBEc8": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Course Detail",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p>Our online course is a fully immersive and interactive experience. The training is accessed through our easy-to-use online learning platform, and it contains exactly the same information and resources as our face-to-face course. </p><p>The theory and WHS aspect of training includes interactive videos, information and assessments (approx 3-4 hours in total), while the practical component will be <br/>performed via a live video stream with our instructor in our virtual classroom (accessed by Zoom), which is 1 full day (8-9 hours expected).</p><p>Please note that the Australian Standard AS/NZS 3760:2022 changed in 2022, and our training course is now teaching the updated Standard.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aUKp3U": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Use Us",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<ul><li>We have conducted training for over 35,000 satisfied students</li><li>Our Nationally Recognised Course is of the highest industry standard</li><li>We are a Registered Training Organisation (RTO: 40604)</li><li>Real time online classroom learning with trainers are industry professionals and fully qualified</li><li>Interactive and immersive online learning platform</li><li>Test items specific to you or your job, from the comfort of your home or workplace</li><li>Unlimited access to our platform and learning materials </li><li>Upskill yourself anytime that suits you - no waiting for course dates or spots to become available </li><li>Lifetime access to support from our test and tag experts after your course</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
