    "custom_liquid_aAkj64": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width  page-width--narrow\">\n<h2>Portable Appliance Testers (PAT Testers)</h2>\n<p><strong>It is essential that students have access to their own Portable Appliance Tester to use for the online course.</strong></p>\n<p>But don’t worry if you haven’t got your own <a href=\"https://www.portableappliancetesters.com.au/\">PAT Tester</a> yet – our team is ready to take you through all the brands and models available on the Australian market, and help you choose a machine that suits your needs.</p>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "collapsible_content_aqyrc4": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_jP3dUU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the Online Test and Tag Course work? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our Online Test & Tag Course contains the same exact content as our face-to-face training. One of the differences is that the first part of the course is self-paced and will teach you theoretical knowledge, all achieved via videos, animations and reading material. Then, the main feature of this course is learning how to test and tag via our Virtual Classroom (zoom video conference). This is conducted by an experienced trainer, and all students are given help the entire way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9amYtn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is the Nationally Recognised course different to the Short course? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Both the Nationally Recognised and Short Courses are delivered in a face-to-face training session over 1 day. However, the major difference between them is that the Nationally Recognised Course has an additional self-paced OHS (Occupational Health and Safety) online component and is thereby considered the highest qualification (ASQA approved). The course you decide on will largely depend on your particular needs, but most students will complete the Nationally Recognised one for <a href=\"/pages/choosing-right-course\" title=\"Which Test & Tag Course Should I Choose?\">various reasons</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YAFc4k": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the course go for? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The Online Test & Tag Course is more self-paced when compared to traditional classroom training, but we find that most of our students require approximately 6-7 hours to complete the course. The theory part (Work Health and Safety section) of the training is self-paced, and we find that most students allocate about 3-4 hours for this. The practical session is more structured as it is led by our instructor and will take around 8 hours. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DhYd67": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who will be the instructor  on the day? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We have several trainers, all of which are test and tag industry professionals with many years of experience and are fully qualified. In addition, they’re all very friendly and approachable and will make the training an enjoyable experience. Whatever your reason for doing the course is, we guarantee our trainers will give you all the knowledge and skills required to successfully test and tag.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wgai4y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I need technical support or help after the course? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You’ll have the peace of mind knowing that we'll be there when you need us, whether it's by phone, email or in person. Every single student taught by Test & Tag Training receives free lifetime technical support from our team of experts. Guaranteed. This could be anything from how to use a specific appliance tester or how to test and tag a particular electrical appliance. We want to ensure we're making people's jobs easier by offering dependable service and expert advice when you need it most.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
